  "description": "A Blazor-native, accessible, keyboard-first command palette (Ctrl+K / Cmd+K): fzf-style fuzzy search, nested pages, prefix modes, async sources, recents and frecency, global shortcuts and sequences, multi-select, prompts, theming and full templating. Matching, ranking and every decision run in C#; the browser layer only handles the dialog, focus and keys.",
